flowchart TD
    PREP["C · Prepare source and shared instructions"]
    A["A · Independently extract controls"]
    B["B · Independently extract controls"]
    REC["C · Reconcile both extractions"]
    BOUNDS["Same C · Justify control boundaries"]
    REVIEW["D · Audit coverage, evidence and granularity"]
    AMEND["Same C · Correct once"]
    CHECK["Same D · Check corrections once"]
    FREEZE["C · Freeze reviewed controls; preserve holds"]
    PACKET["C · Supply identical controls, context and definitions"]
    TA["Same A · Assign mitigation types"]
    TB["Same B · Assign mitigation types"]
    RA["Same A · Select supported risk targets"]
    RB["Same B · Select supported risk targets"]
    LA["Same A · Label relationships; cite evidence and rationale"]
    LB["Same B · Label relationships; cite evidence and rationale"]
    MREC["Same C · Reconcile types, targets, relationships and abstentions"]
    MREV["Same D · Independently review all mapping decisions"]
    MAMEND["Same C · Correct once"]
    MCHECK["Same D · Check corrections once"]
    DELIVERY["C · Deliver findings, tables, evidence and open questions"]
    FLAG["Any agent, any stage · Flag issue with evidence"]
    HOLD["C · Hold affected scope; continue unaffected work"]
    HUMAN["Human · Decide unresolved question"]
    UPDATE["C · Record decision and route scoped update and verification"]
    PREP --> A & B
    A & B --> REC --> BOUNDS --> REVIEW
    REVIEW -->|Correction needed| AMEND --> CHECK --> FREEZE
    REVIEW -->|Accepted scope proceeds; unresolved scope stays held| FREEZE
    FREEZE --> PACKET --> TA & TB
    TA --> RA --> LA
    TB --> RB --> LB
    LA & LB --> MREC --> MREV
    MREV -->|Correction needed| MAMEND --> MCHECK --> DELIVERY
    MREV -->|Accepted scope proceeds; unresolved scope stays held| DELIVERY
    REVIEW -.-> FLAG
    MREV -.-> FLAG
    FLAG --> HOLD --> HUMAN --> UPDATE
